on decency to follow the Golden Rule.\n\n\"Treat others like you want to be treated.\"\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"UltraTom_","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":4,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266730345254313985","date":1590847023000,"rawContent":"I am emotionally exhausted from this shit, but will always stand with my Brown &amp; Black brothers, sisters &amp; siblings. The fight isn't &amp; won't be done with these riots in the US.\n\nSystematic racism needs to be abolished GLOBALLY.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter always and forever.","media":null,"username":"UltraTom_","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266731069560283137","date":1590847196000,"rawContent":"If the fucking AMISH people, the ones who don't use any technology, see everything that's been happening &amp; have been protesting, too, you have no excuse to turn a blind eye to any of this.\n\nI'm gonna hop off social media for the rest of the day. Stay safe. #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"UltraTom_","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267348741318680577","date":1590994460000,"rawContent":"I cou